# Kinaesthetic AI Site Rules

- Keep `/play` simple: camera, status, tilt risk, readiness, coach command, recovery proof.
- Do not touch `app.py` for site polish work.
- Never store raw video/audio/frames.
- LIVE requires fresh real signal. DEMO, STALE, and OFFLINE must be labeled honestly.
- Hide advanced tester/investor tools from the default player surface.
- Before handoff, run syntax, pytest, e2e, mojibake scan, and desktop/mobile visual QA.
- Camera bugs are P0: verify click listener, permission flow, `video.srcObject`, placeholder visibility, and layout overlap.

